<title>USA: Interpore to sell dental business.</title>
<headline>Interpore to sell dental business.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interpore International said it signed a letter of intent to sell its dental business to Friatec AG of Mannheim, Germany.</p>
<p>&quot;In recent years, Interpore's dental business has become a smaller portion of our overall business,&quot; David Mercer, president and chief executive officer said in a statement.</p>
<p>Mercer said the company is committed to expanding its orthamedic biomaterials business, and anticipates the continued growth and market penetration for Pro Osteon, its synthetic bone graft product.</p>
</text>
